    "source_en": "Order of Honor: Glaicier",
    "source_hash": "6797c8d3afcef338315867eb000d424fe6f5286d",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorGoods",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "45",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Dragon Beard Crisp",
    "source_hash": "acfd5a16a37fc13bdd898ce9138b5e0a1c59b1c1",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "2",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Tell me whenever you feel strange. N-not for the sake of the quests. I just... feel you might need me.",
    "source_hash": "69820bf8180084cd7e2c596b35c3ac02e2887193",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "4",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "The wind flowed beside my ears and whispered a spellbinding story, do you wish to hear it?",
    "source_hash": "15f2d70d5ba6ad1597477cf8feb4eb5f04af6404",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "6",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Those beautiful raise yearnings in us. Dawns after long nights, breezes after rainstorms, and... and your smiling face.",
    "source_hash": "bc92a75fa994813d773078666ab9ce3677d823c2",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "8",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Streams around you are different: they disturb minds that come too close. But I can't just stand aside and watch. I want to stay close to you if I may, no matter what storm you will bring.",
    "source_hash": "9a286bf5bd84b6cb7aed62cc7ad68b761810e4b4",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "10",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Call my name when you’re in need... From lands of desolation to places of vibrancy, from beginning to end of the world, I shall witness everything at your side as long as you wish.",
    "source_hash": "35ff029ca89740db1aa1e60660da7b0eccb70a44",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "12",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Songs are resonances that burst from the bottom of your heart. They carry the sincerest feelings.",
    "source_hash": "7eb5a082ba14ebab6f2dff42d49ad9c8abc4e593",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "14",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Will it bring burdens to people... when you care too much for them?",
    "source_hash": "efec0d5768d92b018c4335fd73b9254d6e04306b",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "16",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Wuthercake, Four-Great Tofu, Tiancheng Maocai... Let me show you some local dishes next time. Oh, they are all my favorites, no particular order.",
    "source_hash": "860e3f194e6b660276753bb0fea0a955e780bbb0",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "18",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Shouldn't any food be treated seriously? Hm? If, if it's unpalatable cuisine...",
    "source_hash": "dcfa30c32a59fea17249f04e43c034e021513ff0",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "20",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Those beautiful things do exist, even if they don't happen to me. To only witness and watch over them is sufficient for me.",
    "source_hash": "edbfd7b094a17219511ea13785a8f5ee42d23d4e",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "22",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Interested in my ribbon? It's gift from a wild friend for my admission into Midnight Rangers. Stripes of winds are engraved upon to celebrate a rebirth, and also remind me of the true purpose.",
    "source_hash": "e0c54a812d7344616af8ae9de6e7bbc9b915b5d5",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "24",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Sharp senses once put me in severe pains. Messages flooded from everywhere with noisiness, disorder, and violence, and I was but a feather in the storm. However... (deeply breathing) it's OK... it's all gone. I have found the key to stabilizing the direction, and by that, I have found you.",
    "source_hash": "ee592c7e00fc73ab706a22139e343c178ff34bd7",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "26",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Happy birthday, Rover. (clear throat and start singing) Happy birthday to you, happy birthday to you...",
    "source_hash": "fae35f8eeaac22380d1d89348b6b4f3d02b5e329",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "28",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Falling lightly and lingeringly... Where in the distance will we be led to?",
    "source_hash": "3d98a5eaa64e4fdd0eafc96dbac0a13c6a7353d1",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "30",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Wind scatters things, and gathers things. Coming and going is a constant of nature. Don't mind it too much.",
    "source_hash": "8e86192b7b9082b7663eb358757ac71ccb4a0449",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "32",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Can I sing you another song when... I am more prepared?",
    "source_hash": "8eb1e71f88182fd878e70ef7050cbc97c06dc999",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "34",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "I am Yangyang. The flowing streams of wind guided me to you... I have a vision that for a long time coming, we will keep each other accompanied for the journey.",
    "source_hash": "2099072f2dadb21c295d238730333d3d20ee5169",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "36",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Listen to the sounds in wind with me.",
    "source_hash": "83eabd62148f5fa415fa093ca084ef352a158d5e",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "38",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "The lark's song is about to sound.",
    "source_hash": "c50fb81c0b8a7bbc6d7c91fb7a3784bbeda76bef",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "40",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "To the best of me, I will respond to your expectations.",
    "source_hash": "57edb5f7387fbbc43e3df2601428a6c4e15a45ae",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "42",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Wind strikes.",
    "source_hash": "79d561b3ebdbe9c38097b4508f5655f9aca569b1",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "44",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Converge.",
    "source_hash": "22a8231ada69bed8293f2601916896e8157dd613",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "46",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Howling turbulence.",
    "source_hash": "2f78e2c46a0fda4b44b68a91e0cf4cbaa05d0ca2",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "48",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "The shapeless breaks the shaped.",
    "source_hash": "59d567200d97036720aabd6ac4e64408ebdefe41",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "50",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Storm, take everything.",
    "source_hash": "5428396f09f9ba00d12a14050585599c0e89f247",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "52",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Waltz of the streams.",
    "source_hash": "b255baad1c9667eecf8f07463f047094f8e08a72",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "54",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Doesn't matter.",
    "source_hash": "40a33c22c5bd6992d396e30347625b846c1791e3",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "56",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "D, don't worry about me.",
    "source_hash": "9bc161498ffd4af01fe4c5e94463d6b03939e2b3",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "58",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "I shall... fight back!",
    "source_hash": "af54e926bb2d8f1d2e5e6068f7eed675683af7ce",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "60",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Let me take it...",
    "source_hash": "84c58fd8364a22fe315b563b33085dd7b6f6d72b",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "62",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "It's not breaking me.",
    "source_hash": "46cf9e872b57b5fce5064378470b65236c4402bf",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "64",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "This, isn't working...",
    "source_hash": "2ace61ff0e1acd8e1ead9d0a310b836efb7e8d98",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "66",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Only... making it here with you.",
    "source_hash": "773190952d91d33904efff73980956d9b09c3c82",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "68",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Is the wind... stilling...",
    "source_hash": "e7267c87a5085a7604d910c0ddd503b906047fce",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "70",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Sorry, maybe I...",
    "source_hash": "558b39166578e3a6f2b4239f4d9a06e39c05876f",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "72",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Please.",
    "source_hash": "1245ce8e7b2be274d39bd9251b97b7f4d0d31641",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "74",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "I resonate with winds.",
    "source_hash": "ed5c99e6a2795af57b4a68fcb253cd0a91d7973c",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "76",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "I am your blade.",
    "source_hash": "11d4fc7d5a98f934f77670401e5fc2fdca6fb21a",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "77",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Hand Glider",
    "source_hash": "9ba7986ef5f6c498d299de4fc39887f01147c5c1",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "78",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Meeting the touch of winds --",
    "source_hash": "64fa62326aabe6548241f9b04cfecf211c357a10",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "82",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "I'm speeding it up.",
    "source_hash": "8ba624950a443b342bd4ac45e73913d589f8cbca",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
    "table": "FavorWord",
    "primary_key_column": "Id",
    "primary_key": "84",
    "column": "Content",
    "source_en": "Step on wind, and go.",
    "source_hash": "0044ccf3d26b929a66e04a7008ec9fc171519be7",
    "category": "general"
  },
  {
    "database": "lang_favor.db",
